WEBVTT

00:02:57.963 --> 00:03:02.030
the more motivation we need
to do that thing.

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:04.263
And you might have noticed,

00:03:04.297 --> 00:03:08.563
but motivation isn't something
that we can always muster on command.

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:10.630
Whether we like it or not,

00:03:10.663 --> 00:03:15.163
motivation comes and motivation goes.

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:17.097
When motivation wanes,

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:20.563
plenty of research shows
that we human beings

00:03:20.563 --> 00:03:23.697
tend to follow the law
of the least effort,

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:26.030
meaning we just do the easiest thing.

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:30.763
New behaviors tend to require
a lot of effort,